/* Editorial bilingual edition of seven user-supplied mind maps. Full original Chinese extractions are separately preserved as unverified source records. */
(()=>{const E=(date,z,e,...branches)=>({date,z,e,branches});window.filmHistory=[
{id:'uk',z:'英国',e:'United Kingdom',scope:['从早期放映、布莱顿实验，经纪录片传统与战后制作，到自由电影、英国新浪潮及后续独立路线。原图的欧洲合作与爱尔兰题材分支也保留；它不是单一英格兰风格史。','From early exhibition and Brighton experiments through documentary and postwar production to Free Cinema, the British New Wave, and later independent routes. The map’s European cooperation and Irish-subject branches remain; this is not a history of one English style.'],eras:[
E('1890s–1900s','放映、奇观与布莱顿','Exhibition, attractions & Brighton',
['早期生产与观众','Early production and audiences','原图从 1896 年的公开放映、集市展映、Robert W. Paul 与 Cecil Hepworth 的技术和故事实验切入。不要把某一次早期实验当作电影语言只有一个发明者的证据。','The map starts with public screenings in 1896, fairground exhibition, and technical and story experiments by Robert W. Paul and Cecil Hepworth. A pioneering experiment does not establish a sole inventor of film language.'],
['布莱顿学派：观看如何被剪辑','Brighton: editing the act of looking','G. A. Smith：《祖母的放大镜》《望远镜中所见》《玛丽·珍妮的灾难》；James Williamson：《中国教会被袭记》；Hepworth 路线：《义犬救主》。观察主观视点、近景、动作连续与追逐；殖民题材同时需要历史批判。','G. A. Smith: Grandma’s Reading Glass, As Seen Through a Telescope, Mary Jane’s Mishap; James Williamson: Attack on a China Mission; the Hepworth route: Rescued by Rover. Study viewpoint, close framing, continuity, and chase, while critically contextualizing colonial subjects.'],
['研究史与待核片名','Research history and unresolved identifications','原图提及 1978 年布莱顿会议对早期电影研究的推动。原图《汽车的婚礼》若对应通常所指的 Runaway Match / Elopement à la Mode（1903），AFI 署名为 Alf Collins，而不是 Esmé Collings；不据此作“第一部追车片”的绝对断言。','The map notes the impact of the 1978 Brighton conference on early-film research. If the map’s Automobile Wedding refers to the commonly associated Runaway Match / Elopement à la Mode (1903), AFI credits Alf Collins, not Esmé Collings; no absolute first-car-chase claim is imposed.']),
E('1920s–1930s','产业合作与声音转型','Industry cooperation & sound',
['Film Europe 与国际市场','Film Europe and international markets','原图把英、德、法的合作放在好莱坞竞争之下：联合制作、出口、跨国明星与资本试图扩大市场，后来遇到配额、经济危机、语言和声音设备成本的阻力。','The map places British, German, and French cooperation against Hollywood competition: coproduction, exports, stars, and capital sought larger markets, then faced quotas, economic crisis, language, and sound-equipment costs.'],
['配额、制片厂与发行','Quotas, studios, distribution','1927 年配额制度及 quota quickies、制片扩张、1937 年危机与 1938 年立法是原图的制度线。Alexander Korda《英宫艳史》与 Hitchcock 的惊险片，展示国际化与本土制作之间的关系。','The 1927 quota system and quota quickies, studio expansion, the 1937 crisis, and 1938 legislation form the map’s institutional line. Alexander Korda’s The Private Life of Henry VIII and Hitchcock’s thrillers show relations between international ambition and local production.'],
['声音不是一夜替代默片','Sound did not replace silence overnight','从 Vitaphone 等系统、进口歌舞片到 Hitchcock《讹诈》，观察技术引入如何改变表演、改编、历史题材和国际发行。原图也把 1932 年创刊的 Sight and Sound 放进电影文化机构的形成。','From systems such as Vitaphone and imported musical films to Hitchcock’s Blackmail, study changes in performance, adaptation, historical subjects, and export. The map also includes Sight and Sound’s 1932 launch in the development of film culture.']),
E('1920s–1952','纪录电影与公共机构','Documentary & public institutions',
['Grierson 与机构链条','Grierson and institutional succession','John Grierson《漂网渔船》（1929）是入口；EMB → GPO → Crown 的机构变化把赞助、国家目的与形式实验连接起来。EMB 的帝国贸易使命不能被写成完全中立的社会服务。','Begin with John Grierson’s Drifters (1929). EMB → GPO → Crown links sponsorship and state purposes to formal experiment. The EMB’s imperial-trade remit should not be rewritten as wholly neutral social service.'],
['声音、劳动与集体','Sound, work, collectivity','《锡兰之歌》《住房问题》《夜邮》；Humphrey Jennings 的《伦敦能挺住》《倾听英国》《战火已起》。观察评论、环境声、诗性并置和普通人的劳动，而不是把纪录片等同无创作介入。','Song of Ceylon, Housing Problems, Night Mail; Humphrey Jennings’s London Can Take It!, Listen to Britain, and Fires Were Started. Study commentary, location sound, poetic juxtaposition, and work without equating documentary with absence of creative intervention.'],
['延续与制度终点','Continuities and institutional endings','战争时期的信息部与独立制作并存。Crown Film Unit 于 1952 年关闭，结束一个机构阶段，不等于英国纪录片或公共影像创作从此死亡。','Ministry of Information work coexisted with independent production during the war. Crown Film Unit closed in 1952: an institutional phase ended, not British documentary or public filmmaking itself.']),
E('1940s–1950s','战后制作、文学与类型','Postwar craft, literature & genre',
['制作传统与作者选择','Craft traditions and authorial choices','Powell / Pressburger《我知道我去哪里》；David Lean《相见恨晚》《远大前程》《雾都孤儿》；Carol Reed《虎胆忠魂》《堕落的偶像》《第三人》。对比文学来源、情绪空间与视觉组织，而不把精工制作等同保守。','Powell / Pressburger’s I Know Where I’m Going!; David Lean’s Brief Encounter, Great Expectations, Oliver Twist; Carol Reed’s Odd Man Out, The Fallen Idol, The Third Man. Compare literary sources, emotional space, and visual organization without equating craft with conservatism.'],
['类型、资金与观众','Genre, finance, audiences','Ealing 喜剧与 Eady Levy 是原图的另外两条线：喜剧中的共同体、发行与票房再分配，说明美学选择不能脱离生产条件。','Ealing comedy and the Eady Levy form two further lines: communal comedy, distribution, and box-office redistribution connect aesthetics with production conditions.']),
E('1956–1960s','自由电影与英国新浪潮','Free Cinema & the British New Wave',
['从短纪录到长片','From documentary shorts to features','1956–59 年 NFT 的六组 Free Cinema 节目，与后来的社会写实长片相连，但两者不能直接当成同一组织。轻装拍摄、普通生活和个人眼光是重要观察点。','Six Free Cinema programs at the NFT in 1956–59 connect to later social-realist features, but are not simply the same organization. Lightweight filming, everyday life, and a personal eye are useful points of study.'],
['愤怒的青年与阶级空间','Angry young people and class space','Karel Reisz《星期六晚上和星期天早上》；Lindsay Anderson《如此运动生涯》；Jack Clayton《金屋泪》；Tony Richardson《愤怒的回顾》。Richard Burton 是后者主演，不是导演。原图亦记录 Screen 杂志（1959）。','Karel Reisz’s Saturday Night and Sunday Morning; Lindsay Anderson’s This Sporting Life; Jack Clayton’s Room at the Top; Tony Richardson’s Look Back in Anger. Richard Burton is its star, not director. The map also records Screen magazine (1959).']),
E('1980s onward','电视、独立制作与多种英国','Television, independents & plural Britains',
['政策与新资金','Policy and new funding','Thatcher 时期的政策变动、Channel 4 与《画师的合同》《我的美丽洗衣店》，以及 1985 年配额和 Eady Levy 的结束，改变了制作的入口。Aardman《小鸡快跑》（2000）属于后续延展，不应误放成 1980 年代出品。','Policy changes under Thatcher, Channel 4 and The Draughtsman’s Contract / My Beautiful Laundrette, plus the end of quotas and the Eady Levy in 1985, altered routes into production. Aardman’s Chicken Run (2000) is a later extension, not a 1980s release.'],
['商业与类型的多条路线','Multiple commercial and genre routes','《四个婚礼和一个葬礼》《诺丁山》；Danny Boyle《浅坟》《猜火车》；Guy Ritchie《两杆大烟枪》；《光猪六壮士》《莎翁情史》。这些例子并不共享一种固定的“英国风格”。','Four Weddings and a Funeral, Notting Hill; Danny Boyle’s Shallow Grave and Trainspotting; Guy Ritchie’s Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels; The Full Monty and Shakespeare in Love. These examples do not share one fixed British style.'],
['记忆、政治与跨国制作','Memory, politics, international production','《隐藏的议程》《风吹麦浪》《因父之名》《哭泣游戏》保留原图的爱尔兰政治支线；Ken Loach《小孩与鹰》、Mike Leigh、Derek Jarman《蓝》与 James Ivory 是其他作者路线。图中的《甘地》《印度之行》《看得见风景的房间》《英国病人》《烈火战车》《法国中尉的女人》《象人》提示跨国资本与“遗产电影”问题，而非纯民族归属。','Hidden Agenda, The Wind That Shakes the Barley, In the Name of the Father, and The Crying Game retain the Irish-political branch; Ken Loach’s Kes, Mike Leigh, Derek Jarman’s Blue, and James Ivory mark other authorial routes. Gandhi, A Passage to India, A Room with a View, The English Patient, Chariots of Fire, The French Lieutenant’s Woman, and The Elephant Man prompt questions of international finance and heritage cinema rather than pure nationality.'])],notes:[
['《愤怒的回顾》导演应为 Tony Richardson；Richard Burton 是主演。','Look Back in Anger is directed by Tony Richardson; Richard Burton stars.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/reviews/look-back-anger-archive-review-best-young-british-film-our-generation'],
['区分 BFI 1933 年成立与 1983 年获皇家特许；Crown 关闭是 1952 年。','Distinguish BFI’s founding in 1933 from its 1983 Royal Charter; Crown closed in 1952.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/strategy-policy/bfis-royal-charter','http://www.screenonline.org.uk/film/id/469778/index.html'],
['配额和 Eady Levy 于 1985 年终止；“80 年代以后”包含后来出品，并非全部发生于该十年。','Quotas and the Eady Levy ended in 1985; the post-1980s branch includes later releases.','http://www.screenonline.org.uk/film/id/1051523/index.html'],
['原图《汽车的婚礼》按 Runaway Match / Elopement à la Mode 对应时，导演是 Alf Collins，不是 Esmé Collings；保留译名对应的说明。','For the Automobile Wedding / Runaway Match identification, the director is Alf Collins, not Esmé Collings; the translated-title identification is stated explicitly.','https://catalog.afi.com/Film/31756-ELOPEMENT-A-LA-MODE']
]},
{id:'germany',z:'德国',e:'Germany',scope:['从早期 Autorenfilm、魏玛的多种美学，到纳粹控制、战后产业和新德国电影。移民、国家宣传、电视资金与发行制度，与风格史并读。','From early Autorenfilm and plural Weimar aesthetics through Nazi control, the postwar industry, and New German Cinema. Read migration, state propaganda, television finance, and distribution alongside style.'],eras:[
E('1890s–1910s','早期生产与 Autorenfilm','Early production & Autorenfilm',
['放映、明星与文学','Exhibition, stars, literature','原图从 1895 年放映、Asta Nielsen 的明星地位与戏剧文学进入电影切入。Autorenfilm 强调作家、剧场声望与改编，不等于后来“导演作者论”的同义词；1910 年前也并非没有德国电影生产。','The map begins with 1895 exhibition, Asta Nielsen’s stardom, and literature and theater entering cinema. Autorenfilm emphasizes writers, theatrical prestige, and adaptation, not the later auteur theory; German production did not begin only after 1910.'],
['代表片与制作背景','Examples and production context','Max Reinhardt 的戏剧联系；《另一个人》《乡村道路》《布拉格的大学生》（均属 1913 年前后的创作线）。一战进口限制与 1917 年 Ufa 的形成改变生产规模；战后通胀和出口形成另一种成本条件。','Theatrical links through Max Reinhardt; The Other, The Country Road, and The Student of Prague around 1913. Wartime import restrictions and Ufa’s formation in 1917 changed scale; postwar inflation and exports created different cost conditions.']),
E('1919–1920s','喜剧、历史巨制与表现主义','Comedy, historical spectacle & expressionism',
['Lubitsch 的空间与暗示','Lubitsch: space and implication','《牡蛎公主》《杜巴里夫人》《野猫》与《结婚圈》：比较对象、门与场外信息如何制造喜剧。《结婚圈》（1924）已属 Lubitsch 的美国阶段，不应全算作德国本土出品。','The Oyster Princess, Madame DuBarry, The Wildcat, and The Marriage Circle: study objects, doors, and withheld information in comedy. The Marriage Circle (1924) belongs to Lubitsch’s American period, not wholly to domestic German production.'],
['表现主义不是只有阴影','Expressionism is more than shadows','Robert Wiene《卡里加里博士的小屋》（1920）；Fritz Lang《三生记》《大都会》（1927）；Paul Wegener《泥人》；F. W. Murnau《诺斯费拉图》；Paul Leni《蜡像馆》。布景变形、身体姿态、光线与心理并置，不必在每一部影片中以同样方式出现。','Robert Wiene’s The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari (1920); Fritz Lang’s Destiny and Metropolis (1927); Paul Wegener’s The Golem; F. W. Murnau’s Nosferatu; Paul Leni’s Waxworks. Distorted sets, gesture, lighting, and psychology do not appear identically in every film.'],
['跨国流动不是同一批逃亡','Migration was not one single exodus','1920 年代赴美发展、产业重组与 1933 年后因纳粹迫害流亡，要分开讨论。不能把所有离德电影人的时间和原因都写成同一种。','Career moves to Hollywood in the 1920s, industrial reorganization, and exile under Nazi persecution after 1933 must be distinguished rather than assigned one time and cause.']),
E('1920s','室内剧、新客观派与街道','Kammerspiel, New Objectivity & the street',
['室内剧与摄影机解放','Kammerspiel and the unchained camera','编剧 Carl Mayer；Lupu Pick《碎片》《除夕》；Leopold Jessner《后楼梯》；Murnau《最卑贱的人》。小人物、有限空间、视觉叙述与运动摄影的关系，比“完全没有字幕”等绝对规则更值得观察。','Writer Carl Mayer; Lupu Pick’s Shattered and New Year’s Eve; Leopold Jessner’s Backstairs; Murnau’s The Last Laugh. Relations among ordinary people, restricted spaces, visual narration, and moving camera matter more than absolute claims of no intertitles.'],
['新客观派与社会观察','New Objectivity and social observation','G. W. Pabst《没有欢乐的街》把社会条件、物质压力与街道空间联系起来。表现主义、室内剧和新客观派是并存和交错的路线，不是所有导演依序更换的制服。','G. W. Pabst’s The Joyless Street connects social conditions, material pressure, and street space. Expressionism, Kammerspiel, and New Objectivity overlap rather than form uniforms every director changed in sequence.']),
E('1930s–1945','声音与纳粹的控制','Sound & Nazi control',
['有声片的多种可能','Plural possibilities in sound','Lang《M 就是凶手》；Pabst《西线战场 1918》；《会议在跳舞》《蓝天使》。语言、歌曲与声画关系改变了表演和类型，并不只是把默片加对白。','Lang’s M; Pabst’s Westfront 1918; The Congress Dances and The Blue Angel. Language, song, and audiovisual relations altered performance and genre rather than merely adding speech to silent film.'],
['宣传与娱乐的政治责任','Political responsibility in propaganda and entertainment','纳粹制度控制下，娱乐与直接宣传并存。原图列《汉斯·韦斯特马尔》《希特勒青年团团员奎克斯》《犹太人苏斯》及 Riefenstahl《意志的胜利》（1935）、《奥林匹亚》。这些应作为意识形态与迫害机制的批判性研究，不是可脱离内容欣赏的“纯技术典范”。','Under Nazi control, entertainment coexisted with direct propaganda. The map lists Hans Westmar, Hitler Youth Quex, Jud Süß, and Riefenstahl’s Triumph of the Will (1935) and Olympia. Study these critically as ideological and persecutory mechanisms, not as pure technique detached from content.']),
E('Postwar–1960s','战后产业与奥伯豪森','Postwar industry & Oberhausen',
['战后市场','The postwar market','原图聚焦西德的本土类型、Heimatfilm、好莱坞竞争与“爸爸的电影”批评。这一范围不等于东西德历史完全相同，也不是战后德国电影的全部。','The map focuses on West German domestic genres, Heimatfilm, Hollywood competition, and criticism of Papa’s cinema. This does not make East and West German histories identical or exhaust postwar German film.'],
['制度与新人','Institutions and new filmmakers','1962 年奥伯豪森宣言、1965 年 Kuratorium junger deutscher Film；Alexander Kluge《昨日女孩》；Jean-Marie Straub 与 Danièle Huillet《安娜·玛格达莱娜·巴赫编年史》。把宣言、资助与实际发行条件连起来看；Huillet 的共同作者身份不能省掉。','The Oberhausen Manifesto (1962), Kuratorium junger deutscher Film (1965); Alexander Kluge’s Yesterday Girl; Jean-Marie Straub and Danièle Huillet’s The Chronicle of Anna Magdalena Bach. Link manifestos and subsidies to distribution, and retain Huillet’s coauthorship.']),
E('1970s onward','新德国电影与后续分流','New German Cinema & later routes',
['不同作者，不是一套风格','Different authors, not one style','Schlöndorff《铁皮鼓》与和 Margarethe von Trotta 合作的《丧失名誉的卡塔琳娜·布鲁姆》；Herzog《卡斯帕尔·豪泽之谜》《陆上行舟》；Fassbinder《爱比死更冷》《恐惧吞噬灵魂》、西德女性三部曲与《雾港水手》。','Schlöndorff’s The Tin Drum and The Lost Honour of Katharina Blum, codirected with Margarethe von Trotta; Herzog’s The Enigma of Kaspar Hauser and Fitzcarraldo; Fassbinder’s Love Is Colder Than Death, Ali: Fear Eats the Soul, BRD trilogy, and Querelle.'],
['旅行、身份与跨国视野','Travel, identity, international horizons','Wenders《爱丽丝城市漫游记》《歧路》《公路之王》《巴黎，德州》《柏林苍穹下》。电视与补贴、电影人发行组织、1982 年 Fassbinder 去世及作者的国际发展，是变化的条件而不是某天整齐终结的证据。','Wenders’s Alice in the Cities, Wrong Move, Kings of the Road, Paris, Texas, and Wings of Desire. Television, subsidies, filmmaker distribution, Fassbinder’s death in 1982, and international careers indicate changing conditions, not an exact collective end date.'],
['1990 年代与以后','The 1990s and beyond','Tom Tykwer《罗拉快跑》，以及《Der bewegte Mann》《超越寂静》《勇往直前》等原图后续支线，提示商业、移民与新一代作者的多元路线。《超越寂静》通常列为 1996，不应只按某地 1997 年发行当作唯一年份。','Tom Tykwer’s Run Lola Run and the map’s later branches including The Most Desired Man, Beyond Silence, and Head-On suggest plural commercial, migrant, and authorial routes. Beyond Silence is generally dated 1996; a 1997 territorial release is not its only year.'])],notes:[
['《卡里加里博士的小屋》公映年 1920；《大都会》公映年 1927，不是 1924。','Caligari was released in 1920; Metropolis in 1927, not 1924.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/lists/10-great-german-expressionist-films'],
['Riefenstahl 1935 年片名为《意志的胜利》／Triumph of the Will；纠正原图含混的胜利片名。','Riefenstahl’s 1935 film is Triumph of the Will; the map’s ambiguous victory title is normalized.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/film/9c2d0c54-6f7d-5a5e-94e6-5e9c3dc73b4e/triumph-of-the-will'],
['Kuratorium 并未在 1976 年解散；官方沿革记述其持续发展及 1982 年改制。','Kuratorium was not dissolved in 1976; its official history records continuity and reconstitution in 1982.','https://www.kuratorium-junger-film.de/ueber-uns'],
['《除夕》有 1923 制作／1924 公映的片目差异，不把原图 1923 武断判错。','New Year’s Eve has 1923 production / 1924 release variation; the map’s 1923 is not simply declared wrong.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/film/aa6cdabd-1fa7-5e63-be12-cef6a0bf5963/sylvester']
]},
{id:'italy',z:'意大利',e:'Italy',scope:['保留原图从早期史诗、法西斯产业机构、新现实主义到现代主义及类型片的分支。风格是有差异的实践，不是“只有外景、没有表演”的教条。','Retains the map’s early epics, Fascist institutions, neorealism, modernism, and genre branches. Style is a varied practice, not a doctrine of only locations and no performance.'],eras:[
E('1900s–1910s','史诗、女星与早期工业','Epics, divas & early industry',
['规模、历史与出口','Scale, history, export','从 1905 年前后本土工业的发展，到《庞贝城的末日》《暴君焚城录》（Quo Vadis?，1913）与《卡比利亚》（1914），观察历史奇观、空间深度与国际市场。原图也把法国电影的工业影响列为背景。','From domestic industrial development around 1905 to The Last Days of Pompeii, Quo Vadis? (1913), and Cabiria (1914), study historical spectacle, depth, and international markets. The map also notes French industrial influence.'],
['diva 与类型延展','The diva and genre extensions','《爱情永存》《阿松塔·斯皮纳》等女星电影，以身体、阶级、情欲和服装组织观看；Maciste 系列与《马奇斯特在地狱》代表另一类奇观路线，不应都压成同一种“历史大片”。','Diva films such as Love Everlasting and Assunta Spina organize viewing through body, class, desire, and costume; Maciste and Maciste in Hell represent another spectacular route rather than the same historical-epic category.']),
E('1919–1930s','危机与法西斯时期机构','Crisis & Fascist-era institutions',
['战后衰退与国家介入','Postwar decline and state intervention','原图从一战冲击、1919 年 UCI 联合体与 1920 年代衰退，进入 1922 年后的法西斯统治。政策、审查、娱乐与宣传交错，不能把国家扶持简单当作美学成就的保证。','The map moves from the First World War, the UCI combine of 1919, and 1920s decline to Fascist rule after 1922. Policy, censorship, entertainment, and propaganda intersect; state support does not automatically produce aesthetic achievement.'],
['基础设施的年代','Infrastructure chronology','LUCE 的起源为 1924；威尼斯电影节 1932；电影部门 1934；Centro Sperimentale 1935；Cinecittà 与《黑与白》期刊 1937。它们既是制作和教育条件，也处在威权制度之中。','LUCE originated in 1924; Venice Film Festival in 1932; the film directorate in 1934; Centro Sperimentale in 1935; Cinecittà and Bianco e Nero in 1937. These supported production and education within an authoritarian system.']),
E('1940s–1950s','新现实主义：处境与伦理','Neorealism: conditions & ethics',
['前奏与代表作品','Precursors and key films','Blasetti《云中四步曲》；Visconti《沉沦》（1943）；De Sica《孩子们在注视我们》；Rossellini《罗马，不设防的城市》（1945）；Visconti《大地在波动》（1948）；De Sica《偷自行车的人》（1948）；De Santis《罗马十一时》（1952）。Cesare Zavattini 的编剧与理论劳动是重要支线。','Blasetti’s Four Steps in the Clouds; Visconti’s Ossessione (1943); De Sica’s The Children Are Watching Us; Rossellini’s Rome, Open City (1945); Visconti’s La terra trema (1948); De Sica’s Bicycle Thieves (1948); De Santis’s Rome 11:00 (1952). Cesare Zavattini’s writing and theory form an important branch.'],
['实践特征，不是排除法','Working tendencies, not exclusions','普通人的生计、战争创伤、外景、后期配音、职业与非职业演员并用；长镜头、纵深、偶然性、椭圆与开放结尾是观察方向，不是每片全部具备的规定。新现实主义不等于没有编剧、放弃场面调度或演员没有技巧。','Livelihoods, war damage, locations, post-dubbing, and mixed professional/nonprofessional casts; long takes, depth, contingency, ellipsis, and open endings are tendencies, not requirements in every film. Neorealism does not mean no writing, no mise-en-scène, or no acting skill.'],
['争论与影响','Debates and influence','原图保留战后贫困、左翼思想、现实伦理及 1950 年代初的争论；运动的“结束”不应被看成影响消失。Comencini《面包、爱情和幻想》（1953）引出所谓粉红新现实主义与喜剧转向。','The map retains postwar poverty, left politics, realist ethics, and early-1950s debates. An ending of the movement does not mean its influence vanished. Comencini’s Bread, Love and Dreams (1953) introduces pink neorealism and a turn toward comedy.']),
E('1950s–1960s','现代主义：疏离与记忆','Modernism: alienation & memory',
['Antonioni：空间不只作背景','Antonioni: space is more than background','《奇遇》《夜》《蚀》与《红色沙漠》（1964）；再延伸到《放大》《一个女人的身份证明》《云上的日子》。观察空场、等待、现代建筑与人的不适。《红色沙漠》是 Antonioni 首部彩色长片，不是世界第一部彩色片。','L’avventura, La notte, L’eclisse, and Red Desert (1964), extending to Blow-Up, Identification of a Woman, and Beyond the Clouds. Study empty space, waiting, modern architecture, and unease. Red Desert was Antonioni’s first color feature, not the world’s first color film.'],
['Fellini：经验如何变形','Fellini: experience transformed','《大路》《骗子》《卡比利亚之夜》；《甜蜜的生活》《八部半》《朱丽叶与魔鬼》；《小丑》《罗马》《阿玛柯德》。把记忆、梦、表演与自我反思分开观察，而不是把所有片都当作现实主义的简单反面。','La strada, Il bidone, Nights of Cabiria; La dolce vita, 8½, Juliet of the Spirits; The Clowns, Roma, Amarcord. Distinguish memory, dreams, performance, and self-reflection rather than reducing all to the opposite of realism.']),
E('1960s onward','身体、政治与类型电影','Bodies, politics & genre cinema',
['Pasolini 与 Bertolucci','Pasolini and Bertolucci','Pasolini“生命三部曲”《十日谈》《坎特伯雷故事集》《一千零一夜》，以及《萨罗》；Bertolucci《同流者》《巴黎最后的探戈》《一九〇〇》《末代皇帝》。身体和历史的表述需要连同权力、观看与制作语境讨论。','Pasolini’s Trilogy of Life—The Decameron, The Canterbury Tales, Arabian Nights—and Salò; Bertolucci’s The Conformist, Last Tango in Paris, 1900, and The Last Emperor. Read bodies and history with power, spectatorship, and production context.'],
['意式西部片与声音','Spaghetti westerns and sound','Sergio Leone 的“镖客三部曲”与 Ennio Morricone 的音乐是原图类型支线。距离、特写、等待与音乐共同组织时间，不要把成功都归结成某一项政府政策。','Sergio Leone’s Dollars trilogy and Ennio Morricone’s music form the map’s genre branch. Distance, close-ups, waiting, and music organize time together; success should not be reduced to a single state policy.'])],notes:[
['LUCE 起源应为 1924，不是 1923。','LUCE originated in 1924, not 1923.','https://www.archivioluce.com/chi-siamo/'],
['《大地在波动》1948，不是 1947；《罗马十一时》1952，不是 1951。','La terra trema is dated 1948, not 1947; Rome 11:00 is 1952, not 1951.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/lists/10-great-italian-neorealist-films'],
['《红色沙漠》是 Antonioni 首部彩色长片，不是世界第一部彩色电影。','Red Desert is Antonioni’s first color feature, not the world’s first color film.','https://www.criterion.com/films/1454-red-desert'],
['“不表演、不写作、放弃调度”等绝对说法已改为有差异的实践特征。','Absolute claims of no acting, writing, or mise-en-scène are replaced by varied working tendencies.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/lists/10-great-italian-neorealist-films']
]},
{id:'japan',z:'日本',e:'Japan',scope:['从辩士、歌舞伎与制片厂，经战争和占领、1950 年代名作，到新浪潮、独立制作、当代作者与动画。原图的宽／窄“新浪潮”定义保持区别，不设一个公认终止日。','From benshi, kabuki, and studios through war and occupation, 1950s landmarks, New Wave and independent production, later auteurs, and animation. The map’s narrow and broad New Wave definitions remain distinct, without a supposedly universal end date.'],eras:[
E('Early cinema–1920s','表演传统与制片厂','Performance traditions & studios',
['辩士、类型与女性角色','Benshi, genres, female roles','时代剧／现代剧（jidai-geki / gendai-geki）、歌舞伎影响与现场辩士，说明日本早期观影不只是无声图像。女形（onnagata）是男性扮演女性角色的表演传统，不是“艺伎”的同义词；女性演员与连续性剪辑逐渐改变制作。','Jidai-geki / gendai-geki, kabuki influences, and live benshi show that early Japanese exhibition involved more than silent images. Onnagata are male performers of female roles, not a synonym for geisha; actresses and continuity editing gradually changed production.'],
['工业与实验','Industry and experiment','日活、松竹、1923 年关东大地震及摄影所变化；衣笠贞之助《疯狂的一页》（1926）作为实验路线。不要把制片厂叙事与形式实验当作互不接触的两国。','Nikkatsu, Shochiku, the 1923 Great Kanto Earthquake, and changing studios; Teinosuke Kinugasa’s A Page of Madness (1926) marks an experimental route. Studio storytelling and formal experimentation were not sealed worlds.']),
E('1930s','声音转型与多种写实','Sound transition & plural realisms',
['有声过渡的时间差','An uneven sound transition','《太太与女佣》（1931）与辩士的职业阻力，是原图的声音支线。东宝集团前身在 1932 年建立，东宝映画在 1937 年成立；1934 年开业的剧场不能直接替代公司沿革。山中贞雄《人情纸风船》属于这一时期的重要观察点。','The Neighbor’s Wife and Mine (1931) and benshi resistance form the sound branch. Toho’s corporate predecessor dates to 1932 and Toho Eiga to 1937; a theater opening in 1934 should not replace this chronology. Sadao Yamanaka’s Humanity and Paper Balloons is an important study.'],
['Ozu 与 Mizoguchi','Ozu and Mizoguchi','小津安二郎《浮草物语》《独生子》：低机位、切换与家庭关系；沟口健二《大阪挽歌》《祇园姊妹》：女性处境、长镜头与空间。两人的电影不能各缩成“永远固定”与“永远移动”的口诀。','Yasujiro Ozu’s A Story of Floating Weeds and The Only Son: low camera positions, cuts, family relations; Kenji Mizoguchi’s Osaka Elegy and Sisters of the Gion: women’s situations, long takes, space. Neither oeuvre reduces to always fixed versus always moving.'],
['日常生活的其他作者','Other authors of everyday life','岛津保次郎、成濑巳喜男《愿妻如蔷薇》与清水宏，保留原图关于小市民、女性与日常观察的另外几条路线。','Yasujiro Shimazu, Mikio Naruse’s Wife! Be Like a Rose!, and Hiroshi Shimizu retain the map’s other routes through ordinary people, women, and everyday observation.']),
E('1939–1945','战争、审查与产业整合','War, censorship & industrial consolidation',
['政策与战争责任','Policy and war responsibility','1939 年电影法、资源分配、审查、公司整合与大映形成；满洲映画协会处于日本殖民与战争体系，不能仅当作中性跨国合作。黑泽明《姿三四郎》《最美》列于这一阶段。','The 1939 Film Law, resource allocation, censorship, consolidation, and formation of Daiei; the Manchukuo Film Association belonged to Japan’s colonial and wartime system, not merely neutral international cooperation. Kurosawa’s Sanshiro Sugata and The Most Beautiful appear in this phase.']),
E('1945–1950s','占领、复苏与国际影展','Occupation, recovery & festivals',
['战后生活与制作组织','Postwar life and production structures','占领政策与制片厂重建；成濑《饭》《闪电》《母亲》、五所平之助《烟囱林立的地方》、沟口《女性的胜利》《夜之女》、小津《长屋绅士录》《晚春》。吉村公三郎／新藤兼人的近代映画协会，以及今井正／山本萨夫相关独立路线，保留制片组织的层次。','Occupation policies and studio recovery; Naruse’s Repast, Lightning, Mother; Gosho’s Where Chimneys Are Seen; Mizoguchi’s The Victory of Women, Women of the Night; Ozu’s Record of a Tenement Gentleman, Late Spring. Kindai Eiga Kyokai through Kozaburo Yoshimura / Kaneto Shindo, and routes around Tadashi Imai / Satsuo Yamamoto retain production-organizational detail.'],
['影展与多种“黄金时代”','Festivals and plural golden-age practices','《罗生门》出品于 1950，1951 年获威尼斯金狮奖。黑泽明《七武士》《生之欲》；沟口《雨月物语》《山椒大夫》；小津《东京物语》《麦秋》《早春》《彼岸花》；成濑《浮云》。另有《原爆之子》《浊流》《真空地带》等独立作品，不应只由影展赢家代表全部日本电影。','Rashomon was released in 1950 and won Venice’s Golden Lion in 1951. Kurosawa’s Seven Samurai and Ikiru; Mizoguchi’s Ugetsu and Sansho the Bailiff; Ozu’s Tokyo Story, Early Summer, Early Spring, Equinox Flower; Naruse’s Floating Clouds. Independents such as Children of Hiroshima, An Inlet of Muddy Water, and Vacuum Zone prevent festival winners from standing in for all Japanese cinema.']),
E('1950s–1970s','新浪潮与独立实验','New Wave & independent experiment',
['定义与历史处境','Definitions and historical conditions','原图区分狭义 1959–61 的松竹新浪潮与更宽的战后反叛、安保政治、制片厂和独立实验。把寺山修司 1983 年去世视为广义路线终点，是一种分期意见，不是公认历史事实。','The map distinguishes a narrow Shochiku New Wave around 1959–61 from wider postwar rebellion, security-treaty politics, studio and independent experiments. Using Terayama’s death in 1983 as a broad endpoint is an interpretive periodization, not an agreed fact.'],
['欲望、国家与身体','Desire, nation, bodies','中平康《疯狂的果实》、增村保造《盲兽》、铃木清顺《肉体之门》；今村昌平《猪与军舰》《日本昆虫记》《赤色杀意》，并延伸至《楢山节考》《鳗鱼》《赤桥下的暖流》。不同年代的后期片不应全部误算为 1960 年代出品。','Ko Nakahira’s Crazed Fruit, Yasuzo Masumura’s Blind Beast, Seijun Suzuki’s Gate of Flesh; Shohei Imamura’s Pigs and Battleships, The Insect Woman, Intentions of Murder, extending later to The Ballad of Narayama, The Eel, Warm Water Under a Red Bridge. Later works are not all 1960s releases.'],
['作者、戏剧与 ATG','Authors, theater, ATG','大岛渚《日本的夜与雾》《青春残酷物语》《感官世界》《爱之亡灵》；吉田喜重《秋津温泉》；筱田正浩《心中天网岛》；寺山修司《抛掉书本上街去》。ATG、实相寺昭雄与森田芳光等支线提示替代性制作与形式实验。','Nagisa Oshima’s Night and Fog in Japan, Cruel Story of Youth, In the Realm of the Senses, Empire of Passion; Yoshishige Yoshida’s Akitsu Springs; Masahiro Shinoda’s Double Suicide; Shuji Terayama’s Throw Away Your Books, Rally in the Streets. ATG and branches through Akio Jissoji and Yoshimitsu Morita point to alternative production and experiment.']),
E('1980s onward','后期作者与动画','Later auteurs & animation',
['黑泽明、北野武、黑泽清','Akira Kurosawa, Takeshi Kitano, Kiyoshi Kurosawa','黑泽明《影武者》《乱》《梦》《八月狂想曲》《袅袅夕阳情》；北野武《凶暴的男人》《花火》《那年夏天，宁静的海》《坏孩子的天空》《菊次郎的夏天》，以及后期自反作品；黑泽清《自视性幻觉》（Doppelganger）、《降灵》《岸边之旅》《东京奏鸣曲》。北野与久石让的合作也是原图的声音线索。','Akira Kurosawa’s Kagemusha, Ran, Dreams, Rhapsody in August, Madadayo; Kitano’s Violent Cop, Hana-bi, A Scene at the Sea, Kids Return, Kikujiro, and later self-reflexive films; Kiyoshi Kurosawa’s Doppelganger, Séance, Journey to the Shore, Tokyo Sonata. Kitano’s collaborations with Joe Hisaishi also form a sound-study route.'],
['家庭、青春与风格','Family, youth, style','是枝裕和《幻之光》《如父如子》《步履不停》《比海更深》《小偷家族》；岩井俊二《情书》《花与爱丽丝》《四月物语》；中岛哲也《告白》《被嫌弃的松子的一生》。这些是原图延伸的不同路线，不是一个统一的新运动。','Hirokazu Koreeda’s Maborosi, Like Father, Like Son, Still Walking, After the Storm, Shoplifters; Shunji Iwai’s Love Letter, Hana and Alice, April Story; Tetsuya Nakashima’s Confessions and Memories of Matsuko. These are distinct later routes, not one unified new movement.'],
['动画不是一位导演的附录','Animation is not one director’s appendix','宫崎骏、细田守、今敏、新海诚、森田宏幸、押井守，分别提示世界建构、家庭、主观意识与媒介经验的不同路径。原图的“森田洪幸”校正为“森田宏幸”。','Hayao Miyazaki, Mamoru Hosoda, Satoshi Kon, Makoto Shinkai, Hiroyuki Morita, and Mamoru Oshii suggest differing paths through world-building, family, subjectivity, and mediated experience. The source’s 洪 in Morita’s name is corrected to 宏.'])],notes:[
['东宝集团前身 1932、东宝映画 1937；原图 1934 不能直接充当成立日期。','Toho’s predecessor dates to 1932 and Toho Eiga to 1937; 1934 is not a substitute founding date.','https://www.toho.co.jp/en/company/history/'],
['《罗生门》电影年 1950，威尼斯获奖年 1951。','Rashomon’s film year is 1950; its Venice award is from 1951.','https://www.criterion.com/current/posts/920-rashomon'],
['“森田洪幸”应为“森田宏幸”；女形不等于艺伎。','Hiroyuki Morita’s name uses 宏, not 洪; onnagata should not be equated with geisha.','https://www.ghibli.jp/works/baron/'],
['广义新浪潮“止于 1983”保留为分期意见；不当作公认终止日。个别不明译名只存原文档，不猜造外文片名。','A broad New Wave ending in 1983 is treated as a periodization opinion, not consensus. Unresolved translated titles remain in the source record without invented identifications.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/features/where-begin-japanese-new-wave']
]},
{id:'france',z:'法国',e:'France',scope:['从卢米埃尔／梅里爱，经艺术电影、先锋实验、诗意现实主义，到新浪潮、左岸、真实电影与后续视觉路线。保留原图的理论分支，同时避免把群体差异写成全称规则。','From Lumière / Méliès through Film d’Art, avant-garde experiments, and poetic realism to New Wave, Left Bank, cinéma vérité, and later visual routes. Theory branches remain while group differences are not promoted to universal rules.'],eras:[
E('1895–1900s','记录、排演与艺术电影','Recording, staging & Film d’Art',
['卢米埃尔与梅里爱','Lumière and Méliès','《工厂大门》《水浇园丁》《婴儿的午餐》《火车进站》；梅里爱《贵妇人的失踪》《德莱弗斯事件》《灰姑娘》《月球旅行记》。实景、家庭、新闻、魔术、排演与故事互相交错，不是绝对的“纪录／虚构”二分。','Workers Leaving the Factory, The Sprinkler Sprinkled, Feeding the Baby, Arrival of a Train; Méliès’s The Vanishing Lady, The Dreyfus Affair, Cinderella, A Trip to the Moon. Locations, family, news, magic, staging, and story overlap rather than form an absolute documentary/fiction divide.'],
['Film d’Art 的制作选择','Film d’Art’s production choices','1908 年《吉斯公爵的被刺》：文学、剧场明星、音乐与布景协作。原图关于舞台性与电影语言的批评可作为讨论问题，但不能因此断言法国独占“电影成为艺术”的发明权，或认为所有剧场改编都没有视觉创造。','The Assassination of the Duke of Guise (1908) brings literature, theatrical stars, music, and design together. The map’s critique of theatricality can prompt discussion, without granting France sole ownership of cinema-as-art or denying visual invention in every theatrical adaptation.']),
E('1920s','先锋实验的多条路线','Plural avant-garde routes',
['战后工业与现代主义','Postwar industry and modernism','原图以一战冲击、Pathé（百代）／Gaumont（高蒙）等企业的处境、好莱坞竞争与现代主义艺术，解释先锋实验的背景。工业危机不自动产生某一种美学，跨国影响也不能简化成单向模仿。','The map connects the First World War, the circumstances of firms such as Pathé and Gaumont, Hollywood competition, and modernist art to avant-garde experimentation. Industrial crisis does not automatically produce one aesthetic, nor is international influence simple one-way imitation.'],
['印象主义与 photogénie','Impressionism and photogénie','Louis Delluc 的上镜头性理论、《流浪女》（La Femme de nulle part）；《西班牙的节日》由 Germaine Dulac 导演、Delluc 编剧。Abel Gance《车轮》《拿破仑》、Marcel L’Herbier《黄金国》，让主观感受、风景、移动摄影、叠印和节奏成为电影的问题。','Louis Delluc’s photogénie and La Femme de nulle part; La Fête espagnole is directed by Germaine Dulac and written by Delluc. Abel Gance’s La Roue / Napoléon and Marcel L’Herbier’s El Dorado make subjectivity, landscape, camera movement, superimposition, and rhythm cinematic questions.'],
['纯电影与达达','Cinéma pur and Dada','Fernand Léger《机械芭蕾》、Dulac《957 号唱片》（Disque 957）、René Clair《幕间休息》。物体、机械、视觉舞蹈、反常组合与反传统，是形式实验的不同切口，不等于完全没有主题。','Fernand Léger’s Ballet mécanique, Dulac’s Disque 957, René Clair’s Entr’acte. Objects, machines, visual dance, strange combinations, and anti-tradition offer different formal experiments, not an automatic absence of theme.'],
['超现实与历史评价','Surrealism and historical assessment','Buñuel／Dalí《一条安达鲁狗》与《黄金时代》，Dulac《贝壳与僧侣》：梦、欲望、潜意识和社会攻击。原图强调视觉创新的贡献；“忽视内容所以失败”应当是可争论的评价，不是中性史实。','Buñuel / Dalí’s Un Chien Andalou and L’Âge d’or, Dulac’s The Seashell and the Clergyman: dreams, desire, the unconscious, and social attack. The map stresses visual innovation; failed because they ignored content is a debatable judgment, not neutral historical fact.']),
E('1930s–1940s','诗意现实主义与理论回应','Poetic realism & theoretical responses',
['早期有声与社会空间','Early sound and social space','René Clair《巴黎屋檐下》《百万法郎》《自由属于我们》《七月十四日》；Jean Vigo《操行零分》《亚特兰号》。声音、阶级、诗意、幽默与日常空间之间的关系，并不只有一种悲剧语调。','René Clair’s Under the Roofs of Paris, Le Million, À nous la liberté, Quatorze Juillet; Jean Vigo’s Zero for Conduct and L’Atalante. Sound, class, poetry, humor, and everyday space do not share only one tragic tone.'],
['代表作者与不同实践','Authors and differing practices','Jean Renoir《大幻灭》《游戏规则》《母狗》；Jacques Feyder《大赌博》；Marcel Carné《雾码头》《北方旅店》《天色破晓》；Julien Duvivier《同心协力》；Jean Grémillon《天空属于你们》；Jacques Becker《红手古比》。','Jean Renoir’s La Grande Illusion, The Rules of the Game, La Chienne; Jacques Feyder’s Le Grand Jeu; Marcel Carné’s Port of Shadows, Hôtel du Nord, Le Jour se lève; Julien Duvivier’s La Belle Équipe; Jean Grémillon’s Le Ciel est à vous; Jacques Becker’s Goupi mains rouges.'],
['纵深、文学与巴赞','Depth, literature, Bazin','原图把纵深、场面调度、对白与文学力量，以及 André Bazin 的影像本体论和“木乃伊情结”连起来。把这些当作后来的理论阅读，不必把每部诗意现实主义影片都说成同一种长镜头风格。','The map links depth, mise-en-scène, dialogue, literary force, and André Bazin’s image ontology / mummy complex. These are theoretical readings, not evidence that every poetic-realist film uses the same long-take style.']),
E('Postwar–1950s','优质传统与电影文化','The quality tradition & film culture',
['战后制作与批评对象','Postwar craft and a target of criticism','《夜之门》《田园交响曲》《肉体的恶魔》：文学改编、明星、精工制作与浪漫氛围。所谓 Tradition of Quality 是后来批评争论中的名称，不意味着所有作品只有模式化。','Gates of the Night, La Symphonie pastorale, Devil in the Flesh: adaptation, stars, crafted production, romantic atmosphere. Tradition of Quality belongs to a critical debate, not a verdict that all such films are merely formulaic.'],
['杂志、影迷与作者论','Journals, cinephilia, auteur thinking','Cahiers du cinéma、Bazin、影迷文化、Truffaut 1954 年《法国电影的某种倾向》，连同低成本生产与战后思想背景，形成新浪潮条件。对好莱坞的关系不是一律拒绝：对 Hitchcock 与 Hawks 的推崇也很关键。','Cahiers du cinéma, Bazin, cinephilia, and Truffaut’s 1954 A Certain Tendency of the French Cinema intersect with low-budget production and postwar thought. Hollywood was not rejected wholesale: admiration for Hitchcock and Hawks was important too.']),
E('Late 1950s–1960s','新浪潮与左岸','New Wave & Left Bank',
['年代与作者群','Chronology and authors','Truffaut《淘气鬼》（Les Mistons，1957）是短片；Chabrol《漂亮的塞尔日》（1958）；《四百击》（1959）与戛纳导演奖。Godard《筋疲力尽》《狂人皮埃罗》；Truffaut《夫妻生活》《爱情狂奔》；Rohmer“六个道德故事”“喜剧与谚语”“四季”；Rivette《巴黎属于我们》；Chabrol《表兄弟》。','Truffaut’s Les Mistons (1957) is a short; Chabrol’s Le Beau Serge (1958); The 400 Blows (1959) and its Cannes directing award. Godard’s Breathless / Pierrot le fou; Truffaut’s Bed and Board / Love on the Run; Rohmer’s Moral Tales, Comedies and Proverbs, Four Seasons; Rivette’s Paris Belongs to Us; Chabrol’s Les Cousins.'],
['非整齐的群体边界','Group boundaries are not rigid','Louis Malle《通往绞架的电梯》《情人们》、Jacques Demy《瑟堡的雨伞》《洛拉》；灵活制作、实景、跳切、声音与个人经验，是可比较的实践，不是人人都反政治、人人都同步收音、或运动到 1962 年就完全结束。','Louis Malle’s Elevator to the Gallows / The Lovers, Jacques Demy’s The Umbrellas of Cherbourg / Lola; flexible production, locations, jump cuts, sound, and personal experience are comparative practices, not claims that all were apolitical, all used sync sound, or all activity ended in 1962.'],
['左岸：记忆与声画','Left Bank: memory and sound–image relations','Alain Resnais《广岛之恋》《去年在马里昂巴德》；Alain Robbe-Grillet《横跨欧洲的特快列车》《不朽的女人》；Agnès Varda《五至七时的克莱奥》；Marguerite Duras《黄太阳》；Henri Colpi《长别离》。时间、重复、遗忘、文学与政治，不能压成“新浪潮只拍现实、左岸只拍思想”的二分。原图把 Freud、Sartre、Bergson、Brecht 分别关联到潜意识、存在、直觉与间离：保留为理论阅读线索，不冒称每位导演均自述使用这四套思想。','Alain Resnais’s Hiroshima mon amour / Last Year at Marienbad; Alain Robbe-Grillet’s Trans-Europ-Express / L’Immortelle; Agnès Varda’s Cléo from 5 to 7; Marguerite Duras’s Jaune le soleil; Henri Colpi’s The Long Absence. Time, repetition, forgetting, literature, and politics exceed a New Wave = reality / Left Bank = thought binary. The map links Freud, Sartre, Bergson, and Brecht to the unconscious, existence, intuition, and distancing: these remain theoretical reading routes, not claims that each director professed all four.']),
E('1960s onward','真实电影与后新浪潮','Cinéma vérité & later routes',
['纪录中的参与与反思','Participation and reflection in documentary','Jean Rouch 与 Edgar Morin《夏日纪事》（1961）；Marcel Ophuls《悲哀与怜悯》（1969），不是 Chris Marker。轻型器材、录音、参与式提问与自我反思改变纪录实践；固定三人团队、完全无干预或“第一部”不应当作统一定义。','Jean Rouch and Edgar Morin’s Chronicle of a Summer (1961); Marcel Ophuls’s The Sorrow and the Pity (1969), not Chris Marker. Lightweight equipment, recording, participatory questioning, and reflexivity changed documentary; a fixed three-person crew, no intervention, or first-ever status is not a universal definition.'],
['cinéma du look 与全球路线','Cinéma du look and global routes','Jean-Jacques Beineix《歌剧红伶》《巴黎野玫瑰》；Luc Besson《碧海蓝天》《这个杀手不太冷》；Leos Carax《男孩遇见女孩》《新桥恋人》。视觉、广告／音乐影像经验、亚文化、国际合拍、影展与数字媒介交汇，不意味着“画面强就没有故事”。','Jean-Jacques Beineix’s Diva / Betty Blue; Luc Besson’s The Big Blue / Léon; Leos Carax’s Boy Meets Girl / The Lovers on the Bridge. Visual style, advertising and music-image experience, subculture, international production, festivals, and digital media intersect without making strong images synonymous with no story.'])],notes:[
['《西班牙的节日》导演是 Germaine Dulac，Delluc 是编剧；1919 年拍摄、1920 年公映。','La Fête espagnole is directed by Germaine Dulac and written by Delluc; shot in 1919, released in 1920.','https://www.cinematheque.fr/henri/film/48275-la-fete-espagnole-germaine-dulac-1920/'],
['《淘气鬼》是 1957 年短片，不是 1958 年长片处女作。','Les Mistons is a 1957 short, not a 1958 feature debut.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/film/ab080bd6-ba91-5faf-811e-b94fe4d0515b/les-mistons'],
['《悲哀与怜悯》是 Marcel Ophuls，不是 Chris Marker；《夏日纪事》保留 Morin 共同导演。','The Sorrow and the Pity is by Marcel Ophuls, not Chris Marker; Morin’s codirecting credit is retained for Chronicle of a Summer.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/film/f6840020-20a0-5e27-9176-aead1339823c/the-sorrow-and-the-pity','https://www.bfi.org.uk/film/1a0f6074-ee15-5624-bf02-239ad74edae9/chronicle-of-a-summer'],
['《57 号唱机》校正为 Disque 957；《走卒们》《皇家华尔兹》的确切原文片名暂不确定，不在正文猜造。','Disque 957 replaces the incomplete 57 label; the exact original titles behind the map’s Zou zu men and Royal Waltz remain unconfirmed and are not guessed in the course.','https://www.cinematheque.fr/film/31245.html']
]},
{id:'usa',z:'美国',e:'United States',scope:['从早期电影、制片厂和类型，经反垄断、电视、纪录与实验，到新好莱坞和后续产业。技术创新与种族、审查、劳动、发行和观众一起看；原图的历史公司名单不是今天的所有权表。','From early cinema, studios, and genres through antitrust, television, documentary and experiment to New Hollywood and later industry. Read technique alongside race, censorship, labor, distribution, and audiences; historical company lists are not current ownership charts.'],eras:[
E('1890s–1910s','早期装置与叙事工业','Early devices & narrative industry',
['装置、剪辑与发明神话','Devices, editing, invention myths','Edison／Dickson 的 Kinetoscope 是个人窥视式观影装置，不要与大银幕投影混为一谈。Edwin S. Porter《火车大劫案》（1903）与 D. W. Griffith 的电影让连续与交叉叙事成为重要研究点，但不是某个人独自发明一切剪辑。','Edison / Dickson’s Kinetoscope was a peep-viewing device, not equivalent to projected exhibition. Porter’s The Great Train Robbery (1903) and Griffith’s films invite study of continuity and parallel narration, without crediting one person with inventing all editing.'],
['形式与种族主义不能分开免责','Form does not absolve racism','《一个国家的诞生》是 1915 年，不是 1902；其对白人至上与三 K 党的美化应被明确批判。《党同伐异》（1916）展示不同故事与抽象主题的交叉组织，不消除前作的伤害。','The Birth of a Nation is from 1915, not 1902; its white-supremacist glorification of the KKK must be explicitly criticized. Intolerance (1916) interweaves stories and abstract themes without erasing the earlier film’s harm.'],
['工业组织与另一条纪录路线','Industrial organization and documentary','长片、制片人、专业分工、明星、片场和出口市场相互推动。Robert Flaherty《北方的纳努克》（1922，不是 1916）提供另一条纪录路线，同时需要检视排演与被摄者再现，而不只套用“纪录片之父”的单一英雄称号。','Features, producers, specialized labor, stars, studios, and exports developed together. Flaherty’s Nanook of the North (1922, not 1916) offers a documentary route, while its staging and representation require scrutiny beyond a lone father-of-documentary label.']),
E('1920s','垂直整合、明星与默片类型','Vertical integration, stars & silent genres',
['公司、影院与审查','Companies, theaters, censorship','原图区分当时的 Paramount–Publix、Loew’s／MGM、First National，以及 Universal、Fox、Warner、PDC、FBO 等不同规模与影院资源；不是后来“三大／五大”的永久名单。1919 年 United Artists 由 Chaplin、Pickford、Fairbanks、Griffith 创立；MPPDA 与地方审查／制片法典构成另一制度线。','The map distinguishes contemporary Paramount–Publix, Loew’s / MGM, First National, and differently scaled Universal, Fox, Warner, PDC, FBO: not a permanent big-three or big-five list. United Artists was founded in 1919 by Chaplin, Pickford, Fairbanks, and Griffith; MPPDA, local censorship, and the Production Code form another institutional line.'],
['喜剧的身体与时间','Comic bodies and time','Mack Sennett；Chaplin《安乐街》《寻子遇仙记》《淘金记》，延伸至《城市之光》《摩登时代》《大独裁者》；Buster Keaton《航海家》《将军号》；Harold Lloyd《水手制造者》《安全至下》《新生》。后期有声时代作品不应都误标为 1920 年代。','Mack Sennett; Chaplin’s Easy Street, The Kid, The Gold Rush, later City Lights, Modern Times, The Great Dictator; Keaton’s The Navigator / The General; Lloyd’s A Sailor-Made Man, Safety Last!, The Freshman. Later sound-era works do not all belong to the 1920s.'],
['西部、恐怖、犯罪与分众','Westerns, horror, crime, segmented audiences','John Ford《铁骑》；Lon Chaney《巴黎圣母院》《歌剧魅影》；Josef von Sternberg《下层社会》。Black-audience / race films 的资金与创作者并非同一身份：原图说多数公司白人所有，仍须保留 Oscar Micheaux 等黑人自主制作，不能抹去他们。','Ford’s The Iron Horse; Lon Chaney’s The Hunchback of Notre Dame / The Phantom of the Opera; Sternberg’s Underworld. Financing and creative identity in race films are not identical: majority white ownership must not erase Black independent production such as Oscar Micheaux’s.'],
['动画的工业与作者','Animation industry and authorship','Fleischer 的转描与《墨水瓶里出来》；Disney 的 Oswald 和 Mickey；Pat Sullivan／Otto Messmer 相关的是 Felix the Cat（菲力猫），不是后来漫画角色 Garfield（加菲猫）。流水线组织与具体动画师的贡献应同时看见。','Fleischer’s rotoscoping and Out of the Inkwell; Disney’s Oswald and Mickey; Pat Sullivan / Otto Messmer are associated with Felix the Cat, not the later comic character Garfield. Study pipeline organization together with individual animators’ work.']),
E('1930s–1940s','声音、制片厂与类型','Sound, studios & genre',
['制片厂体系的时间边界','The studio system has temporal boundaries','《爵士歌王》（1927）是同步声音转型的重要节点，不是所有声音电影的第一部。五大 MGM、Paramount、Warner、Fox、RKO，与小三 Universal、Columbia、UA 的生产／发行／影院关系不同；黑人、意第绪语及其他独立制作也存在。','The Jazz Singer (1927) is a major synchronization milestone, not the first of all sound films. The big five—MGM, Paramount, Warner, Fox, RKO—and little three—Universal, Columbia, UA—had differing production/distribution/exhibition relations; Black, Yiddish, and other independent production also existed.'],
['歌舞、喜剧与动画','Musicals, comedy, animation','轻歌剧、后台歌舞与叙事整合：《璇宫艳史》《四十二街》《摇摆乐时代》《封面女郎》《天上人间》。怪诞喜剧：《一夜风流》《二十世纪》。动画：《白雪公主》《木偶奇遇记》《小飞象》《小鹿斑比》及 Fleischer《格列佛游记》。','Operetta, backstage, and integrated musicals: The Love Parade, 42nd Street, Swing Time, Cover Girl, Cabin in the Sky. Screwball: It Happened One Night, Twentieth Century. Animation: Snow White, Pinocchio, Dumbo, Bambi, and Fleischer’s Gulliver’s Travels.'],
['恐怖、社会问题、犯罪、战争','Horror, social problems, crime, war','《木乃伊》与 RKO／Val Lewton；《我们的日常面包》《狂怒》；《国民公敌》《马耳他之鹰》《双重赔偿》；《西线无战事》《菲律宾浴血战》。noir 的边界与“类型／周期”地位可争论；战争片中的宣传与种族刻板印象必须连同形式研究。','The Mummy and RKO / Val Lewton; Our Daily Bread, Fury; The Public Enemy, The Maltese Falcon, Double Indemnity; All Quiet on the Western Front, They Were Expendable. Noir’s boundaries and genre/cycle status are debated; war propaganda and racial stereotypes belong in formal study.']),
E('1930s–1950s','制片厂中的作者路线','Authorial routes within studios',
['导演、表演与类型变体','Direction, performance, genre variation','Sternberg《摩洛哥》《金发维纳斯》；Lubitsch《天堂里的烦恼》；Ford《关山飞渡》；Hawks《女友礼拜五》《只有天使有翅膀》。观察工作制度下的个体选择，而不把个人风格与所有协作劳动对立。','Sternberg’s Morocco / Blonde Venus; Lubitsch’s Trouble in Paradise; Ford’s Stagecoach; Hawks’s His Girl Friday / Only Angels Have Wings. Observe choices within working systems without opposing personal style to all collaborative labor.'],
['表演空间与改编','Performance space and adaptation','Wyler《双姝怨》《红衫泪痕》《呼啸山庄》《小狐狸》，其相关后作《双姝怨》（The Children’s Hour）与早作 These Three 须区分；Borzage《永别了，武器》；Vidor《史黛拉恨史》；Cukor《大卫·科波菲尔》《茶花女》；Walsh《私枭血》《夜困摩天岭》（High Sierra，1941）。','Wyler’s These Three, Jezebel, Wuthering Heights, The Little Foxes, and the later The Children’s Hour must be distinguished; Borzage’s A Farewell to Arms; Vidor’s Stella Dallas; Cukor’s David Copperfield / Camille; Walsh’s The Roaring Twenties / High Sierra (1941).'],
['声音、喜剧、舞蹈与合作署名','Sound, comedy, dance, shared credits','Mamoulian《喝彩》《化身博士》；Minnelli《天上人间》《火树银花》；Sturges《大丈夫》《摩根溪的奇迹》；Huston《马耳他之鹰》；Welles《公民凯恩》《安伯逊情史》；Hitchcock《蝴蝶梦》及 Lang、Wilder 的移民路线。《乐队上场》（Strike Up the Band）导演是 Busby Berkeley，不是 Minnelli；《公民凯恩》编剧包括 Herman J. Mankiewicz 与 Welles。','Mamoulian’s Applause / Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde; Minnelli’s Cabin in the Sky / Meet Me in St. Louis; Sturges’s The Great McGinty / The Miracle of Morgan’s Creek; Huston’s The Maltese Falcon; Welles’s Citizen Kane / The Magnificent Ambersons; Hitchcock’s Rebecca and migration routes through Lang and Wilder. Strike Up the Band is directed by Busby Berkeley, not Minnelli; Citizen Kane is written by Herman J. Mankiewicz and Welles.']),
E('Postwar–1960s','反垄断、电视与新观众','Antitrust, television & new audiences',
['制度重组不只是电视打败电影','Restructuring is more than television beats film','1946 年观影高峰后，HUAC 与黑名单、1948 年 Paramount 反垄断裁决及后续影院剥离、郊区化、电视和海外市场共同改变产业。宽银幕、彩色、3D、路演、汽车影院、艺术影院及面向特定观众的制作，是回应而非同一种技术决定论。','After the 1946 attendance peak, HUAC and blacklisting, the 1948 Paramount antitrust decision and subsequent divestiture, suburbanization, television, and exports reshaped industry. Widescreen, color, 3D, roadshows, drive-ins, art houses, and targeted production were responses, not one technological destiny.'],
['类型继续变化','Genres continued changing','《日落大道》《杀手》《红河》《枪手》《雨中曲》《十诫》《宾虚》《西北偏北》；舞台改编《推销员之死》《欲望号街车》《热铁皮屋顶上的猫》。原图的《金手指》也是英美跨国生产与发行网络的例子，不能只因被好莱坞章节收录就叫纯美国电影。','Sunset Boulevard, The Killing, Red River, The Gunfighter, Singin’ in the Rain, The Ten Commandments, Ben-Hur, North by Northwest; stage adaptations Death of a Salesman, A Streetcar Named Desire, Cat on a Hot Tin Roof. Goldfinger in the map also indicates British–American production and distribution networks, not pure US nationality because it appears in a Hollywood chapter.'],
['独立制作的不同含义','Independent has several meanings','主流项目打包、低成本剥削片、政治或艺术小制作，不是相同的经济结构。Cassavetes 与 Shirley Clarke 的作品提示剧场、纪录与独立剧情之间的往返；电视制作与片库出售也重组收入。','Mainstream package production, low-budget exploitation, and small political/artistic projects have different economies. Cassavetes and Shirley Clarke suggest movement between theater, documentary, and independent fiction; television production and library sales also reorganized revenue.']),
E('1940s–1970s','直接电影与实验电影','Direct cinema & experimental cinema',
['录音、轻型器材与观察','Recording, lightweight equipment, observation','Robert Drew、Richard Leacock、D. A. Pennebaker、Maysles 兄弟：《初选》（1960）、《推销员》（1969）；Frederick Wiseman《提提卡失序》《高中》《法律与秩序》。观察不等于不剪辑、无立场或完全没有声音策略；可与法国参与式纪录比较。','Robert Drew, Richard Leacock, D. A. Pennebaker, the Maysles: Primary (1960), Salesman (1969); Wiseman’s Titicut Follies, High School, Law and Order. Observation does not mean no editing, no position, or no sound strategy; compare French participatory documentary.'],
['诗、形式、禁忌与概念','Poetry, form, taboo, concept','Maya Deren《午后的迷惘》《变形时间的仪式》；Kenneth Anger《天蝎星升起》；James Broughton、Stan Brakhage；Warhol《吃》《帝国》《吹箫》；John Whitney《目录》、Matrix、Permutations。原图的这些分类是学习切口，不是唯一的官方流派表。Michael Snow《波长》（1967）是加拿大作品，因其与北美实验网络的联系而对照，不改成美国国籍。','Maya Deren’s Meshes of the Afternoon / Ritual in Transfigured Time; Kenneth Anger’s Scorpio Rising; James Broughton, Stan Brakhage; Warhol’s Eat, Empire, Blow Job; John Whitney’s Catalog, Matrix, Permutations. These categories are study routes, not an official exhaustive taxonomy. Snow’s Wavelength (1967) is Canadian: compare its North American experimental context without changing nationality.']),
E('1960s–1970s','新好莱坞','New Hollywood',
['社会变化与形式重组','Social change and formal reorganization','反文化、欧洲电影影响、审查松动、青年市场、反英雄、外景和时间实验互相作用。《雌雄大盗》（1967）、《毕业生》（1967）、《逍遥骑士》（1969），以及 Peckinpah《午后枪声》、Arthur Penn《小巨人》，不能简单说成同一年、同一种政治立场。','Counterculture, European influences, loosening censorship, youth markets, antiheroes, locations, and temporal experiments interact. Bonnie and Clyde (1967), The Graduate (1967), Easy Rider (1969), Peckinpah’s Ride the High Country, and Penn’s Little Big Man differ in year and politics.'],
['作者与商业不是一条单线','Authorship and commerce are not one linear story','Coppola《教父》《窃听大阴谋》《现代启示录》；Kubrick《奇爱博士》《2001 太空漫游》《发条橙》；Scorsese《穷街陋巷》《出租车司机》；Lucas《美国风情画》《星球大战》；Spielberg《大白鲨》《第三类接触》；Woody Allen《安妮·霍尔》。','Coppola’s The Godfather, The Conversation, Apocalypse Now; Kubrick’s Dr. Strangelove, 2001, A Clockwork Orange; Scorsese’s Mean Streets / Taxi Driver; Lucas’s American Graffiti / Star Wars; Spielberg’s Jaws / Close Encounters; Woody Allen’s Annie Hall.']),
E('1980s onward','集团、跨媒介与独立路线','Conglomerates, cross-media & independent routes',
['高概念、窗口与历史公司名单','High concept, windows, historical company lists','集团并购、高概念营销、多厅影院、衍生市场与数字化改变制作和发行。原图列 AOL Time Warner、Viacom、News Corp 等，是特定时期的例子，不能当作 2026 年仍原样存在的所有权表。','Conglomeration, high-concept marketing, multiplexes, ancillary markets, and digitization altered production and release. AOL Time Warner, Viacom, News Corp, and other map examples belong to particular periods, not an unchanged 2026 ownership chart.'],
['不同规模的作者路线','Authors working at different scales','Eastwood、Nolan、Oliver Stone、James Cameron、Robert Zemeckis、Spike Lee、Tim Burton；Lynch、Coen 兄弟、Tarantino、Jarmusch 与 Sundance 相关独立路线。它们跨越数十年，不能因在同一分支就全部归成“80 年代导演”。','Eastwood, Nolan, Oliver Stone, James Cameron, Robert Zemeckis, Spike Lee, Tim Burton; Lynch, the Coens, Tarantino, Jarmusch, and Sundance-related independents. They span decades rather than constitute only 1980s filmmakers.'])],notes:[
['《一个国家的诞生》1915，不是 1902；《北方的纳努克》1922，不是 1916。','The Birth of a Nation is 1915, not 1902; Nanook of the North is 1922, not 1916.','https://www.loc.gov/item/95522190/'],
['Pat Sullivan／Otto Messmer 对应 Felix the Cat（菲力猫），不是 Garfield（加菲猫）。','Pat Sullivan / Otto Messmer are associated with Felix the Cat, not Garfield.','https://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n85031301.html'],
['《乐队上场》1940 导演为 Busby Berkeley，不是 Minnelli；《夜困摩天岭》1941，不是 1940。','Strike Up the Band (1940) is directed by Busby Berkeley, not Minnelli; High Sierra is 1941, not 1940.','https://catalog.afi.com/Film/6816-STRIKE-UP-THE-BAND','https://catalog.afi.com/Film/26738-HIGH-SIERRA'],
['《公民凯恩》不应省略 Herman J. Mankiewicz 的共同编剧；Michael Snow／《波长》为加拿大，不因放在美国章节而改籍。','Retain Herman J. Mankiewicz’s cowriting credit for Citizen Kane; Michael Snow / Wavelength are Canadian despite the US chapter placement.','https://cfe.tiff.net/content/films/wavelength','https://catalog.afi.com/Film/27624-CITIZEN-KANE'],
['“多数 race-film 公司白人所有”可有史料支持，但不能抹去 Micheaux 等黑人作者；这是补足，不是把原图的“多数”偷换成“全部”。','Majority white ownership of race-film companies has historical support, but must not erase Micheaux and other Black authors; this is qualification, not misreading most as all.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/features/short-history-black-us-indie-cinema'],
['《化身博士》有 1931 首映／1932 正式发行差异，原图 1932 不判为错误；《将军号》也有 1926／1927 片目差异。','Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde has 1931 premiere / 1932 general-release variation; the map’s 1932 is not declared wrong. The General also has 1926 / 1927 catalog variation.','https://catalog.afi.com/Film/7380-DR.-JEKYLL-AND-MR.-HYDE']
]},
{id:'ussr',z:'苏联／东欧',e:'USSR / Eastern Europe',scope:['原图以苏联电影为主，也包含帝俄前史、东欧社会主义国家与解体后的俄罗斯。这里保留分支但明确地理与政治差别：乌克兰、亚美尼亚、波兰等的电影不能统称为俄罗斯电影。','The map centers on Soviet cinema but includes imperial Russia, socialist Eastern Europe, and post-Soviet Russia. Branches remain with geographic and political distinctions: Ukrainian, Armenian, Polish, and other cinemas are not all Russian cinema.'],eras:[
E('1900s–1920s','前史、革命与机构','Prehistory, revolution & institutions',
['帝俄不等于苏联','Imperial Russia is not the USSR','《斯坚卡·拉辛》（1908）等帝俄电影早于苏联成立。1917 年革命、1919 年电影国有化与电影学校建立，之后才是 1922 年成立的苏联；不能把电影生产的起点推迟到 1920 年代。','Imperial Russian films such as Stenka Razin (1908) precede the USSR. The 1917 revolution, nationalization and film-school establishment in 1919 precede the union formed in 1922; production did not begin only in the 1920s.'],
['资源与传播','Resources and circulation','短缺、进口影片、新经济政策、宣传列车、教育与工人观众，构成原图的制作／发行环境。政治目标与娱乐、喜剧、票房并存，并不意味着所有影片都只有一种宣传语调。','Shortages, imports, the NEP, agit-trains, education, and worker audiences form the map’s production/distribution setting. Political goals coexisted with entertainment, comedy, and box office, rather than one propaganda tone in every film.']),
E('1920s–early 1930s','蒙太奇：不同理论与实践','Montage: different theories & practices',
['Kuleshov 与实验叙述','Kuleshov and accounts of experiment','Lev Kuleshov 的工作坊及“库里肖夫效应”提出镜头语境如何改变意义；历史上的实验记载与今天的普遍心理定律不是一回事。Pudovkin 的学习关系可与此连接，不能把 Vertov 也随意写作其学生。','Kuleshov’s workshop and the Kuleshov effect ask how shot context changes meaning; historical accounts are not identical to a universally established psychological law. Pudovkin’s training connects here, but Vertov should not simply be labeled another pupil.'],
['Eisenstein：冲突与观念','Eisenstein: conflict and ideas','吸引力蒙太奇、冲突与理性蒙太奇；《罢工》（1925）、《战舰波将金号》（1925）、《十月》（1928）。《波将金号》关联的是 1905 年革命二十周年，不是 1917 年革命二十周年。','Attractions, conflict, and intellectual montage; Strike (1925), Battleship Potemkin (1925), October (1928). Potemkin relates to the twentieth anniversary of the 1905 revolution, not the twentieth anniversary of 1917.'],
['Pudovkin 与人物的连接','Pudovkin and character through linkage','《母亲》（1926）、《圣彼得堡的末日》（1927）、《亚洲风暴》（1928）：联想、人物行动与剪辑连接。与 Eisenstein 对读时，不要只把二人简化成“永远连接／永远冲突”的互斥规则。','Mother (1926), The End of St. Petersburg (1927), Storm over Asia (1928): association, action, and editing linkage. In comparison with Eisenstein, do not reduce them to mutually exclusive always-link versus always-collide rules.'],
['Vertov、FEKS 与 Dovzhenko','Vertov, FEKS, Dovzhenko','Vertov 的 Kino-Pravda、Kino-Eye 与《持摄影机的人》（1929），应连同摄影 Mikhail Kaufman 与剪辑 Yelizaveta Svilova 看协作；Kozintsev／Trauberg 的 FEKS、《外套》《新巴比伦》及 Yutkevich；乌克兰作者 Dovzhenko《兵工厂》（1929）《土地》（1930）保留诗性与地域差异。','Vertov’s Kino-Pravda, Kino-Eye, and Man with a Movie Camera (1929) also involve camera work by Mikhail Kaufman and editing by Yelizaveta Svilova; Kozintsev / Trauberg’s FEKS, The Overcoat, The New Babylon, and Yutkevich; Ukrainian Dovzhenko’s Arsenal (1929) / Earth (1930) retain poetic and regional differences.'],
['剪辑工具与历史边界','Editing tools and period boundaries','重叠、省略、节奏、图形冲突、低机位、类型化表演与集体主体，是原图的形式词汇。1933 年《逃兵》可以作转型观察点，不能定为所有蒙太奇实践一夜终结的日期。','Overlap, ellipsis, rhythm, graphic conflict, low angles, typage, and collective subjects form the map’s formal vocabulary. Deserter (1933) can mark a transition, not an overnight end to every montage practice.']),
E('1930s–1940s','声音、社会主义现实主义与战争','Sound, socialist realism & war',
['声画关系与政策','Sound–image relations and policy','1928 年 Eisenstein／Pudovkin／Alexandrov 的声音声明与 1930 年代的声音转型；1934 年社会主义现实主义体制化。政策、审查、领袖崇拜与生产数量变化，会改变什么可以拍、如何观看。','The 1928 sound statement by Eisenstein / Pudovkin / Alexandrov and the 1930s transition; institutionalization of socialist realism in 1934. Policy, censorship, personality cult, and production shifts alter what can be filmed and how it is viewed.'],
['类型、英雄与国家叙述','Genres, heroes, state narratives','Vasiliev 兄弟《夏伯阳》；“马克辛三部曲”、《亚历山大·涅夫斯基》《肖尔斯》、“高尔基三部曲”、《列宁在十月》《列宁在一九一八》。把类型吸引力与国家叙述的机制一起分析，不只记英雄名字。','The Vasiliev brothers’ Chapaev; the Maxim trilogy, Alexander Nevsky, Shchors, Gorky trilogy, Lenin in October, Lenin in 1918. Analyze genre appeal together with mechanisms of state narrative rather than memorizing heroes alone.'],
['战争中的生产','Production during war','疏散、新闻片与战争剧情片：《区委书记》《玛申卡》《她保卫祖国》《卓娅》《虹》。资源、地点、动员与受难的再现，是原图的战争支线。','Evacuation, newsreels, and war features: The District Secretary, Mashenka, She Defends the Motherland, Zoya, Rainbow. Resources, locations, mobilization, and representation of suffering form the wartime branch.']),
E('Postwar–1960s','东欧制度与解冻','Eastern European institutions & the Thaw',
['国有化不是一条完全相同的道路','Nationalization did not mean identical paths','战后东欧的制片组织、学校、类型与政策各不相同；波兰电影学派和创作小组、Aleksander Ford《巴尔斯卡街的五个少年》是原图支线。南斯拉夫在 1948 年与 Stalin 决裂，不能把此后所有年份都说成苏联控制完全相同。','Postwar Eastern European production units, schools, genres, and policies varied; the Polish School, creative units, and Aleksander Ford’s Five from Barska Street form branches. Yugoslavia broke with Stalin in 1948, so later years cannot all be described as identical Soviet control.'],
['1953 与 1956 要分开','Distinguish 1953 from 1956','Stalin 1953 年去世，苏共二十大是 1956 年。解冻中的普通士兵、私人情感、战争创伤与表达性摄影，不能只归结为一个单一政策开关。','Stalin died in 1953; the Twentieth Party Congress was in 1956. Ordinary soldiers, private feeling, war trauma, and expressive photography in the Thaw cannot be reduced to one policy switch.'],
['代表影片与国际传播','Key films and circulation','Chukhrai《第四十一》《士兵之歌》（1959）；Kalatozov《雁南飞》（1957，1958 戛纳金棕榈）；Bondarchuk《一个人的遭遇》；Tarkovsky《伊万的童年》。把电影年份、影展获奖年份和当地上映年份分开记。','Chukhrai’s The Forty-First and Ballad of a Soldier (1959); Kalatozov’s The Cranes Are Flying (1957, Cannes Palme d’Or 1958); Bondarchuk’s Fate of a Man; Tarkovsky’s Ivan’s Childhood. Keep film dates, festival awards, and territorial release dates separate.']),
E('1960s–1970s','多国新浪潮与苏联后续作者','Plural New Waves & later Soviet auteurs',
['不能把东欧压成一个国家','Eastern Europe is not one country','Polanski 的波兰路线、捷克斯洛伐克新浪潮、1968 年布拉格之春及入侵后的正常化；南斯拉夫、匈牙利、罗马尼亚、保加利亚各自的制作与审查背景。保留原图的区域联系，不抹去差异。','Polanski’s Polish route, the Czechoslovak New Wave, the Prague Spring of 1968 and normalization after the invasion; distinct Yugoslav, Hungarian, Romanian, and Bulgarian contexts of production and censorship. Retain regional connections without erasing differences.'],
['政策、战争记忆与私人生活','Policy, war memory, private life','原图的 1972 年政策讨论，以及《这里的黎明静悄悄》与《莫斯科不相信眼泪》（1980）显示跨年代延展。Tarkovsky《安德烈·鲁布廖夫》《飞向太空》《镜子》；Parajanov《石榴的颜色》（1969，亚美尼亚制作），不能仅因苏联总标签就都称俄罗斯电影。','The map’s 1972 policy discussion, The Dawns Here Are Quiet, and Moscow Does Not Believe in Tears (1980) span decades. Tarkovsky’s Andrei Rublev, Solaris, Mirror; Parajanov’s The Color of Pomegranates (1969, Armenian production) should not all become Russian films under an undifferentiated Soviet label.']),
E('1980s–1990s','公开性、解体与市场危机','Glasnost, dissolution & market crisis',
['重估历史与私人处境','Revisiting history and private life','公开性／改革时期的历史重估、禁片重现与新题材；《小薇拉》（1988）是原图例子。1991 年苏联解体之后，各共和国的工业、语言与市场路线不同，不能合并成一个从未变化的产业。','Reappraisal of history, release of suppressed films, and new subjects under glasnost/perestroika; Little Vera (1988) is the map’s example. After dissolution in 1991, republics followed different industrial, linguistic, and market paths rather than one unchanged industry.'],
['市场压力不是百分之百消失','Market pressure is not total disappearance','盗版、融资困难与进口竞争是危机条件。原图“1999 年完全被好莱坞占领”改为市场压力的概括，不作百分之百的统计断言，也不宣告本土创作从此不存在。','Piracy, financing difficulties, and import competition formed crisis conditions. The source’s completely occupied by Hollywood in 1999 becomes a qualified description of market pressure, not a 100% statistic or a claim that local filmmaking ceased.'])],notes:[
['帝俄在 1908 年已有《斯坚卡·拉辛》等剧情制作，不能从 1920 年代才计算电影起点。','Imperial Russia had narrative production such as Stenka Razin in 1908; the starting point is not only the 1920s.','https://www.istanbulmodern.org/en/film/stenka-razin'],
['1925 年《波将金号》纪念 1905 年革命二十周年，不是 1917 年革命二十周年；Vertov 不随意列成 Kuleshov 学生。','Potemkin (1925) marks twenty years after 1905, not 1917; Vertov is not simply assigned as a Kuleshov pupil.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/lists/10-great-soviet-films-1920s'],
['1953 年 Stalin 去世，1956 年二十大；《士兵之歌》1959，不是 1958。','Stalin’s death was in 1953 and the Twentieth Congress in 1956; Ballad of a Soldier is 1959, not 1958.','https://www.bfi.org.uk/film/8fd5645f-ac78-52a7-b705-4d5ad5476cac/ballada-o-soldate','https://digitalarchive.wilsoncenter.org/topics/nikita-khrushchev-collection'],
['苏联不等于俄罗斯；东欧国家也不等于苏联。《莫斯科不相信眼泪》1980；“1999 完全被占领”不作为统计事实。','USSR is not synonymous with Russia, nor Eastern Europe with USSR. Moscow Does Not Believe in Tears is 1980; the 1999 total-occupation claim is not treated as a statistic.','https://www.peramuseum.org/film/moscow-does-not-believe-in-tears/1078/190']
]}
];})();
